    {
      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> To create the `password_reset.py` file that starts a password reset flow for a local account using a concrete external provider, I need to choose a provider that offers password reset functionality via an API. One such provider is Auth0, which provides a robust identity management platform with comprehensive APIs for various authentication flows, including password reset. I will use Auth0's Management API to implement the password reset functionality. </thinking>\n\n",
        "time": {
          "end": 1789887219119,
          "start": 1789887216327
        },
        "type": "text"
      },
      "id": "prt_0bd977ac7001x7DIs30L65wznT",
