      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> To implement the refresh_session.py file, I need to integrate with a concrete external provider for refreshing an expired session or access token. I will use the Amazon Cognito service for this task, as it provides a robust identity management solution with support for refreshing tokens. The integration will be identifiable by the use of the Boto3 library, which is the Amazon Web Services (AWS) SDK for Python, and the specific client class for Cognito Identity Provider. </thinking>\n",
        "time": {
          "end": 1789887213432,
          "start": 1789887211476
        },
        "type": "text"
      },
      "id": "prt_0bd9767d4001ki7ix2E1W6KbBT",
